Cell["\<\
DiagramExtract::shdw: 
   Symbol DiagramExtract appears in multiple contexts 
    {FeynArts`, Wolfram`DiagrammaticComputation`Diagram`Surgery`}
    ; definitions in context FeynArts`
     may shadow or be shadowed by other definitions.\
\>", "Message", "MSG",ExpressionUUID->"b5ff183c-b445-4bbc-9eb9-dbbd7da249d4"],

